cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this catalogue, please cite it as below."
title: "Pakistan Evidence Catalogue: staggered district-level programmes for causal impact evaluation"
abstract: >-
  An open catalogue of 67 public programmes and natural experiments in Pakistan
  rolled out unit by unit over time at or below the district level, with 322
  programme-outcome pairs, 102 outcome definitions and 55 datasets mapped
  against them, documented rollout districts for 13 entries, and a district
  crosswalk on constant 2019 boundaries.
type: dataset
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
license: CC-BY-4.0
